  "description": "King Kong Play Park is the biggest structure in our Forestia series. A central tower in Forest Green and Sand Beige carries tube slides and bridges outward in several directions, with climbing walls and nets around it. The aerial view shows it on a circular safety surface, which is how we suggest laying it out. Children aged 3 to 12 can climb, slide, balance, hop and crawl across it, so a whole class or a crowd at a park can use it together. The product area is 50'1\" x 42'5\" and the safe play area is 56'1\" x 48'5\". Capacity is listed as 15 children. King Kong Play Park has a 3-year warranty on galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Talk to us about it for a municipal park, resort or large township.",
